msgid "First matching rule wins. An unavailable fixed exit blocks matching connections. Rules affect new connections."
msgstr "按顺序匹配首条规则。固定出口不可用时阻断匹配的连接。规则对新连接生效。"

msgid "Lower priority values win; healthy members at the same priority share new connections by weight. Keep offline members to preserve their configuration."
msgstr "优先使用较小的优先级；相同优先级的健康链路按权重分配新连接。离线成员保留其配置。"

msgid "Share new IPv4 connections across WAN and cellular uplinks. Each connection keeps its exit. Software forwarding is used while enabled; disable mwan3 first."
msgstr "在 WAN 和蜂窝上行之间分配新的 IPv4 连接，每条连接保持原出口。启用后使用软件转发，请先停用 mwan3。"

msgid "Distribute new IPv4 connections across WAN and cellular uplinks. Each connection keeps its exit. Software forwarding is used while enabled. Disable mwan3 before enabling this manager."
msgstr "在 WAN 和蜂窝上行之间分配新的 IPv4 连接，每条连接保持原出口。启用后使用软件转发。请先停用 mwan3。"
